weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>7 x 2 = 14</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>8 : 4 = 3</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>9 x 3 = 27</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>16 : 2 = 7</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">19.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Manakah operasi hitung yang menghasilkan 18?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>2 x 9</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>3 x 6</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>4 x 5</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>9 x 1</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">20.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Manakah pembagian yang hasilnya kurang dari 5?</span></span></p><div style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px;"><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>A. <span>8 : 2</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>B. <span>12 : 4</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>C. <span>20 : 5</span></p><p style="margin: 2px 0px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="margin-right: 8px;">☐</span>D. <span>18 : 2</span></p></div></div><div style="margin-bottom: